{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Enjoy 3 games!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One is a competitive <u>board</u> game. Read the rules to win the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other is a cooperative game. Each player is assigned a keyboard <u>arrow key</u> and can only move in that direction. Work with your partner to advance through the stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The third game is a <u>slide</u> mode with special tiles and the goal is to avoid obstacles and reach the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Just Enjoy!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this competitive board game, bomb your friends' way cards and send emojis to cheer them on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Take the challenge!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try this challenging co-op game with your friends! It won't be easy! (very hard)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><u>If you would like to give your opinion, please join Discord</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Board Winner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3490020/2e212b94e8b82d43f3b1e28d9d74be106a4153d6.jpg"},{"name":"Arrow Key Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3490020/8fb2f3e780f16afca1a1f6f7eec53073c1101d47.jpg"},{"name":"Slide Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3490020/ca578e8d1fb8eb34bc26890ae6721f64edf001a7.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3490020?t=1746848125","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3490020?t=1746848125","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490020/55e72737af4f69397d0b12b9c0a87295b8aac3d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746848